  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Humanitarian Diplomacy in Europe Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Diplomacy support in IFRC Europe Region (includes Central Asia).&#xa0;This proposal aims to enhance the IFRC-BRC collaboration to advance HD outcomes in Europe region, with focus on four main outcomes:
1.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; Coordination: Coordinated humanitarian diplomacy efforts across the IFRC Network in Europe region
2.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; Data and analysis: Strengthened systematic consolidation and analysis of data for humanitarian diplomacy through &#x2018;Impact Forecasting&#x2019;, studies and research 
3.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; Capacity strengthening: Strengthened HD skills and capacities
4.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; Reinforcing principled humanitarian action: Enhanced understanding and respect for Red Cross and Red Cross principled humanitarian action, including the reinforcement of the NS auxiliary role, among key stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
